<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on the DTB Bund Future.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on the DTB Bund Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) has issued 12 million American-style call and put warrants, in 12 equal tranches, on the DTB-BUND-Future, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	  ISS PRICE    MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	  104.23 PCT    0.83 DEM     22.AUG.97</p>
<p> PUT B	   104.23 PCT    2.87 DEM     22.AUG.97</p>
<p> CALL C	  103.16 PCT    1.63 DEM     20.NOV.97</p>
<p> PUT D	   103.16 PCT    2.62 DEM     20.NOV.97</p>
<p> CALL E	  104.00 PCT    1.65 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> PUT F	   104.00 PCT    3.43 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> CALL G	  102.00 PCT    2.54 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> PUT H	   102.00 PCT    2.35 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> CALL I	  100.00 PCT    3.73 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> PUT J	   100.00 PCT    1.58 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> CALL K	   98.00 PCT    5.12 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> PUT L	    98.00 PCT    1.01 DEM     19.FEB.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE	 06.MAR.97     LISTING	FFT DDF</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   102.19 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
